name: The Benson (Coast Hotels)
---
website: https://www.coasthotels.com/hotels/oregon/portland/the-benson-hotel/
---
description:

Founded in 1913, the Bensons is set in the "Bridge City" area of Portland just
across the river from Revolution Hall. It's within walking distance to all of
the shopping, dining, and entertainment of the Pearl District, Pioneer Square,
and downtown. It provides one of the more traditional hotel experiences.
